@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Top 3 parts by revenue in each category
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/top-parts

### Monthly sales and change from previous month
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/monthly-sales

### Model reliability: repairs count, average repair time, rank inside brand
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/model-reliability

### Same, only models with at least 3 repairs
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/model-reliability?minRepairs=3

### Invalid threshold (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/model-reliability?minRepairs=0